bundles/
node_modules/
*.log

# Avatar renders, written by the render worker and keyed by a hash of the
# fairy's appearance. A cache: anything missing is redrawn on first view.
#
# swf/containerLib.swf and swf/avatarRenderer.swf are NOT ignored. They are
# built (render/build-*.ps1) rather than authored, but everything else in
# swf/ is a shipped binary too, and the site is served straight off this
# tree -- an ignored one would mean a deploy where the renderer silently
# 404s at boot.
rendered/
